      "writtenOn": "2026-10-15T06:17:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes. X.509 allows repeated attributes, and the DN is printed from the least to the most specific RDN, so the last CN is the most specific one.\nRFC 2818 section 3.1 says to use the most specific CN:\nhttps://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2818#section-3.1",
      "parentUuid": "805fc236_434dfa0c",
